{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf New sensory slow-motion action for those thirsty for novel gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited slow motion activates while aiming your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemy attacks like a dancer using slow motion, then unleash a devastating counter-attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Endless unlockables and upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who reach the very end of the abyss will be able to learn the &quot;ultimate skill&quot; that can light up the entire abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Forge your own strategy with diverse combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight safely by parrying all enemy attacks, lay down skills like mines for a counter-hit, or engage in an all-out close-range brawl\u2014you can create a vast variety of combat styles depending on your skill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Your grand coming-of-age ceremony beyond the fourth wall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a poem dedicated to the nostalgic games that were with us in childhood, the adults who created them, you who have now followed in their footsteps to become an adult, and to all the adults and children who will continue to build more memories through games and life.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654120/bbbec8433d8cb4f1ee4ceb81c53aaca85ee76252.jpg"},{"name":"Assemble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654120/bebf61f28758064705aa6ae1dac553f7500eaaf4.jpg"},{"name":"Pirate Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654120/e0ab00fff95f509f744c2ddd67c20f34d6059bd2.jpg"},{"name":"The Chosen One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654120